                <p>The Kozue's 5D Human-like Vario Motion mechanism with 27 live pressure sensors is a meaningful technological distinction. The roller actively adjusts throughout the session — not just at the start based on a body scan. Few chairs in this segment offer real-time pressure adaptation at this level.</p>
