                <h3>Chair Doctor AI Personalization</h3>
                <p>Both JP Medics models feature Chair Doctor Powered by AI — a biofeedback-driven system that reads your body's current state (including stress and heart rate inputs) before tailoring the session. Meaningfully different from brands that simply run a body scan and execute a preset program.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar-card">
                <div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.57 14.86L22 13.43 20.57 12 17 15.57 8.43 7 12 3.43 10.57 2 9.14 3.43 7.71 2 5.57 4.14 4.14 2.71 2.71 4.14l1.43 1.43L2 7.71l1.43 1.43L2 10.57 3.43 12 7 8.43 15.57 17 12 20.57 13.43 22l1.43-1.43L16.29 22l2.14-2.14 1.43 1.43 1.43-1.43-1.43-1.43L22 16.29z"/></svg></div>
                <h3>Curated Lineup Over Broad Catalog</h3>
