                <div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 21h-1l1-7H7.5c-.58 0-.57-.32-.38-.66l5-10.67h1l-1 7h3.5c.49 0 .56.33.47.51L11 21z"/></svg></div>
                <h3>Japanese Premium Engineering Feel</h3>
                <p>The JP Medics massage feel is quieter, more measured, and more precise than many brands that prioritize intensity and feature count. Buyers who find assertive rollers uncomfortable consistently respond well to the JP Medics approach in in-person sessions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar-card">
                <div class="pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg></div>
                <h3>Meaningful Style and Ownership Detail</h3>
                <p>JP Medics models include elevated ownership features: the Kozue offers aromatherapy, chromotherapy shoulder lighting, and Monster Bluetooth audio. The KaZe Duo includes voice control (Alexa/Google), wireless charging, and a 1-inch wall saver. Genuine differentiators at this price tier.</p>
