            <p><strong>The most useful brand comparison happens in person.</strong> Spec comparisons help narrow your shortlist. But the feel difference between JP Medics' sensor-led precision, Fujiiryoki's therapeutic depth, and Osaki's assertive intensity is only truly understood when you sit in each chair. At our San Jose and Pleasanton showrooms, we carry multiple premium brands side-by-side for this kind of guided comparison.</p>
